1
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:54,840
14 properties!

2
00:00:55,119 --> 00:00:56,399
You've struck it rich!

3
00:00:57,880 --> 00:00:59,359
Well, well, Ma Dawei.

4
00:00:59,600 --> 00:01:02,079
So you're out there being a male homewrecker!

5
00:01:02,759 --> 00:01:03,200
Wait...

6
00:01:03,320 --> 00:01:06,040
Otherwise, where'd you get the money for 14 properties?

7
00:01:06,400 --> 00:01:08,959
Dong Nan called Qianqian today and told her!

8
00:01:09,439 --> 00:01:10,599
That Ma Dawei...

9
00:01:10,840 --> 00:01:11,719
...at the garment factory...

10
00:01:11,719 --> 00:01:13,719
...with some vixen in a red dress...

11
00:01:13,799 --> 00:01:14,719
...was fooling around!

12
00:01:14,959 --> 00:01:16,319
They were even holding hands!

13
00:01:16,319 --> 00:01:16,840
Really?

14
00:01:16,840 --> 00:01:17,159
No!

15
00:01:19,920 --> 00:01:20,519
You've got to believe me!

16
00:01:20,519 --> 00:01:20,959
Dawei!

17
00:01:20,959 --> 00:01:21,560
Ma Dawei!

18
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:24,319
Not only did you wrong our Qianqian,

19
00:01:24,599 --> 00:01:26,200
you were the one who cheated first!

20
00:01:26,319 --> 00:01:27,920
Don't make wild accusations without proof!

21
00:01:28,040 --> 00:01:29,200
Dawei went to the garment factory...

22
00:01:29,200 --> 00:01:30,959
...to rush clothing orders to pay off his debts!

23
00:01:31,280 --> 00:01:32,040
Bullshit!

24
00:01:32,799 --> 00:01:34,760
Who knows if that's true or not!

25
00:01:35,560 --> 00:01:36,120
Fine.

26
00:01:36,719 --> 00:01:37,680
If you insist on making a scene,

27
00:01:38,079 --> 00:01:39,120
then let's talk about...

28
00:01:39,120 --> 00:01:40,640
...why I broke up with your daughter.

29
00:01:40,719 --> 00:01:42,480
You've got some nerve!

30
00:01:43,400 --> 00:01:43,799
Mom!

31
00:01:43,799 --> 00:01:44,640
Auntie, Auntie...

32
00:01:45,680 --> 00:01:46,680
Don't say anything yet.

33
00:01:51,640 --> 00:01:52,439
Dawei...

34
00:01:53,280 --> 00:01:56,200
Can we talk in private?

35
00:02:12,039 --> 00:02:12,800
Dawei...

36
00:02:12,960 --> 00:02:14,639
We were out of line just now.

37
00:02:15,400 --> 00:02:17,080
My mom was just worried about me,

38
00:02:17,159 --> 00:02:18,400
so she was a bit harsh.

39
00:02:18,400 --> 00:02:19,199
Cut to the chase.

40
00:02:19,199 --> 00:02:20,240
If it's about the houses, forget it.

41
00:02:21,639 --> 00:02:22,439
Dawei...

42
00:02:22,719 --> 00:02:24,199
In your eyes,

43
00:02:24,680 --> 00:02:26,199
am I really that awful?

44
00:02:27,280 --> 00:02:28,479
You say I'm after your houses...

45
00:02:28,840 --> 00:02:29,599
Stay back!

46
00:02:29,960 --> 00:02:32,199
Keep at least a meter's distance between us.

47
00:02:32,439 --> 00:02:34,199
So you don't go telling people I tried to sleep with you.

48
00:02:34,360 --> 00:02:35,120
Back off. Go on.

49
00:02:36,120 --> 00:02:38,080
No matter how big our misunderstanding is,

50
00:02:38,560 --> 00:02:40,800
I still remember how good you were to me.

51
00:02:41,240 --> 00:02:42,360
I just wanted to talk some sense into you.

52
00:02:42,360 --> 00:02:44,280
To risk it all for a few run-down houses,

53
00:02:44,599 --> 00:02:46,719
going head-to-head with a big shot like President Zhao...

54
00:02:46,919 --> 00:02:48,120
what's the point?

55
00:02:48,520 --> 00:02:49,759
What does that have to do with you?

56
00:02:50,560 --> 00:02:51,919
Even if we broke up,

57
00:02:52,159 --> 00:02:53,759
I still want the best for you.

58
00:02:54,039 --> 00:02:54,840
Are you done?

59
00:02:55,039 --> 00:02:55,919
Dawei...

60
00:02:55,960 --> 00:02:57,520
I'm really looking out for you.

61
00:03:02,039 --> 00:03:02,840
Enough.

62
00:03:03,199 --> 00:03:04,240
Drop the act.

63
00:03:04,240 --> 00:03:05,199
It doesn't work on me anymore.

64
00:03:05,199 --> 00:03:06,000
You're a snobbish gold-digger.

65
00:03:06,000 --> 00:03:07,560
You were the one eager to cut ties with me.

66
00:03:07,560 --> 00:03:09,120
Now that you heard I have 14 houses,

67
00:03:09,120 --> 00:03:10,680
you come running over to talk me out of it.

68
00:03:11,039 --> 00:03:12,400
Believe it or not,

69
00:03:12,520 --> 00:03:14,199
I was blind before

70
00:03:14,479 --> 00:03:15,560
and let you waste my time once.

71
00:03:16,120 --> 00:03:17,919
So now, whatever you do,

72
00:03:18,199 --> 00:03:20,560
you're less than pathetic to me.

73
00:03:20,560 --> 00:03:21,360
Ma Dawei!

74
00:03:22,240 --> 00:03:23,479
You really don't know what's good for you!

75
00:03:56,439 --> 00:03:57,159
Wait.

76
00:03:57,599 --> 00:03:59,080
Why are you all staring at me like that?

77
00:03:59,599 --> 00:04:00,759
Is there something on my face?

78
00:04:00,840 --> 00:04:01,560
Dawei,

79
00:04:01,759 --> 00:04:03,439
those fourteen houses you just mentioned...

80
00:04:03,759 --> 00:04:04,800
are they real?

81
00:04:06,800 --> 00:04:07,800
One hundred percent real.

82
00:04:11,280 --> 00:04:12,520
You little bastard!

83
00:04:12,840 --> 00:04:14,560
No matter how broke our family is,

84
00:04:14,960 --> 00:04:16,120
you can't resort to something like this!

85
00:04:16,519 --> 00:04:17,000
Dad,

86
00:04:17,240 --> 00:04:19,079
you don't have to worry about the money for the houses.

87
00:04:19,199 --> 00:04:20,839
Sister Yiyi already said I don't have to pay her back yet.

88
00:04:20,959 --> 00:04:21,519
Besides,

89
00:04:21,639 --> 00:04:22,120
Sister Yiyi is...

90
00:04:22,120 --> 00:04:23,920
the "vixen" Liu Meilan was talking about.

91
00:04:25,199 --> 00:04:26,319
Why do you suddenly care about that?

92
00:04:26,480 --> 00:04:27,160
Anyway,

93
00:04:27,160 --> 00:04:28,519
though your brother here is quite handsome,

94
00:04:28,720 --> 00:04:30,639
selling my body wouldn't fetch that much money!

95
00:04:31,360 --> 00:04:32,680
She really is gorgeous, though.

96
00:04:33,120 --> 00:04:33,519
Wait, no.

97
00:04:34,000 --> 00:04:36,079
We have a purely professional business partnership!

98
00:04:36,519 --> 00:04:37,160
No, wait.

99
00:04:37,439 --> 00:04:38,079
I'm getting all mixed up.

100
00:04:38,279 --> 00:04:38,879
Where was I?

101
00:04:39,800 --> 00:04:41,319
Chengbei Old Street is set for demolition and relocation!

102
00:04:42,360 --> 00:04:43,279
Dem— Demolition and relocation?

103
00:04:43,839 --> 00:04:44,199
Demolish?

104
00:04:44,920 --> 00:04:45,720
Demolition and relocation?

105
00:04:45,920 --> 00:04:46,399
Exactly!

106
00:04:46,639 --> 00:04:49,240
And it's a new commercial center approved by the city.

107
00:04:49,240 --> 00:04:50,560
The official government directive is already out.

108
00:04:50,560 --> 00:04:51,800
It'll be announced in a few days.

109
00:04:51,800 --> 00:04:53,759
When that happens, not only can we clear our debts,

110
00:04:53,759 --> 00:04:55,360
we'll also pocket several million!

111
00:04:58,519 --> 00:04:59,519
Millions?

112
00:05:05,160 --> 00:05:06,160
That's wonderful!

113
00:05:06,800 --> 00:05:07,560
No matter what,

114
00:05:07,560 --> 00:05:08,519
this is amazing!

115
00:05:11,360 --> 00:05:13,639
As long as we can pay off what Dakui owes,

116
00:05:15,040 --> 00:05:17,240
our family won't have to live in fear anymore.

117
00:05:23,519 --> 00:05:24,160
Dad,

118
00:05:25,279 --> 00:05:26,879
our family is saved!

119
00:05:33,160 --> 00:05:33,959
Dad,

120
00:05:34,519 --> 00:05:35,160
Sister-in-law,

121
00:05:37,040 --> 00:05:38,560
you've both suffered so much recently.

122
00:05:39,480 --> 00:05:40,680
But from now on,

123
00:05:41,040 --> 00:05:42,680
as long as I, Ma Dawei, am here,

124
00:05:43,240 --> 00:05:44,720
our family will only see good days!

125
00:05:45,759 --> 00:05:47,759
You two just sit back and relax at home.

126
00:05:47,879 --> 00:05:48,839
In two days at most,

127
00:05:49,240 --> 00:05:50,160
I'll bring our family

128
00:05:50,160 --> 00:05:51,800
an enormous surprise!

129
00:05:54,879 --> 00:05:55,680
A surprise?

130
00:05:56,439 --> 00:05:57,040
Son,

131
00:05:57,720 --> 00:05:58,560
from now on,

132
00:05:58,959 --> 00:06:01,000
as long as you don't bring us any scares,

133
00:06:01,279 --> 00:06:03,079
I'll thank my lucky stars!

134
00:06:19,959 --> 00:06:21,759
I'm talking to you. Why aren't you answering?

135
00:06:22,279 --> 00:06:23,319
What's wrong with you?

136
00:06:23,839 --> 00:06:25,800
That punk is such an ungrateful bastard!

137
00:06:26,319 --> 00:06:28,519
He was dirt-poor when he was with you.

138
00:06:28,759 --> 00:06:29,720
Now, with all those properties,

139
00:06:29,720 --> 00:06:31,040
some of that should be ours!

140
00:06:31,439 --> 00:06:32,519
Go ask him

141
00:06:32,600 --> 00:06:34,959
if all 14 properties have been transferred yet.

142
00:06:35,240 --> 00:06:36,199
If they haven't,

143
00:06:36,720 --> 00:06:38,360
hurry up and marry him!

144
00:06:38,759 --> 00:06:40,639
That way, it'll all belong to both of you!

145
00:06:40,959 --> 00:06:41,800
Mom!

146
00:06:42,120 --> 00:06:43,480
Can you just give me some peace?

147
00:06:43,560 --> 00:06:45,959
I'm only doing this for your own good!

148
00:06:47,920 --> 00:06:49,639
Isn't it just pure dumb luck

149
00:06:49,959 --> 00:06:51,920
that he lucked into buying a few lousy houses?

150
00:06:52,519 --> 00:06:54,120
Ma Dawei, what's so great about you?

151
00:07:01,240 --> 00:07:02,839
I, Zhou Qian, am gorgeous.

152
00:07:03,360 --> 00:07:04,759
I just want to live a good life.

153
00:07:06,040 --> 00:07:07,040
What's wrong with that?

154
00:07:09,519 --> 00:07:12,199
Ma Dawei, you're just a deadbeat pauper with no ambition!

155
00:07:12,399 --> 00:07:13,800
Yet you have the nerve to look down on me!

156
00:07:15,800 --> 00:07:16,800
In that case,

157
00:07:17,560 --> 00:07:19,040
I'll show you

158
00:07:19,920 --> 00:07:22,240
how I become someone on top!

159
00:07:32,279 --> 00:07:33,079
President Zhao,

160
00:07:33,800 --> 00:07:36,040
I failed to get the job done today,

161
00:07:36,480 --> 00:07:38,600
and I feel truly terrible about it.

162
00:07:39,079 --> 00:07:40,639
I'd like to visit the club tonight

163
00:07:41,120 --> 00:07:42,879
to apologize to you in person.

164
00:07:43,560 --> 00:07:44,560
I wonder

165
00:07:45,120 --> 00:07:46,360
if you would do me the honor?

166
00:08:07,079 --> 00:08:07,879
Ma Dawei,

167
00:08:08,879 --> 00:08:11,199
I'll definitely live a better life than you!

168
00:08:11,879 --> 00:08:13,560
My life, Zhou Qian's life,

169
00:08:14,920 --> 00:08:17,959
will never be trapped in this little alley.

170
00:08:25,959 --> 00:08:26,759
President Zhao,

171
00:08:27,120 --> 00:08:30,360
not only did I fail to get the house back today,

172
00:08:30,959 --> 00:08:32,440
but Ma Dawei...

173
00:08:32,799 --> 00:08:34,440
he completely humiliated me.

174
00:08:37,080 --> 00:08:37,799
I'm sorry.

175
00:08:38,279 --> 00:08:38,679
I...

176
00:08:38,879 --> 00:08:40,279
let you down.

177
00:08:46,399 --> 00:08:47,159
Qianqian,

178
00:08:48,279 --> 00:08:49,840
the house is nothing.

179
00:08:49,840 --> 00:08:51,279
You're just a girl,

180
00:08:51,399 --> 00:08:54,080
going head-to-head with a thug like Ma Dawei.

181
00:08:54,440 --> 00:08:55,480
That must have been rough for you.

182
00:08:56,799 --> 00:08:59,120
I was just too naive before.

183
00:08:59,320 --> 00:09:00,159
I always thought

184
00:09:00,159 --> 00:09:01,600
sticking with a man through hardships

185
00:09:01,600 --> 00:09:02,759
would eventually pay off.

186
00:09:03,240 --> 00:09:04,519
Until I met you,

187
00:09:04,639 --> 00:09:05,559
only then did I realize

188
00:09:05,559 --> 00:09:07,039
what it feels like to be protected

189
00:09:07,039 --> 00:09:08,879
by a mature man

190
00:09:09,120 --> 00:09:10,600
of true vision.

191
00:09:17,080 --> 00:09:18,320
I'm glad you understand.

192
00:09:21,480 --> 00:09:22,639
As long as you're with me,

193
00:09:23,320 --> 00:09:25,000
from now on in Nancheng City,

194
00:09:25,799 --> 00:09:27,399
no one will dare mistreat you.

195
00:09:35,639 --> 00:09:36,799
Don't leave tonight.

196
00:09:38,799 --> 00:09:40,120
Come back with me for another drink.
